WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.930
A readable route begins with a destination the player can recognize.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:08.121
Put the beacon above the surrounding shapes.

00:00:08.121 --> 00:00:13.124
Use a repeated line to connect the foreground with the next platform.

00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:17.113
Leave one optional path that returns to the main route.

00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:22.479
At the landing zone, repeat the beacon color so arrival feels intentional.

00:00:22.479 --> 00:00:27.989
These diagrams describe a fictional level, not footage from a released game.

